Third-party material
--------------------

This project contains no third-party source code. It builds against the Go
standard library only.

Test fixtures use publicly published values:

  * MILENAGE test vectors from 3GPP TS 35.207/35.208 (Test Set 1).
  * The subscriber key material in connectors/sdcore/testdata/ is the well-known
    public test key used throughout open-source 5G core documentation. It is test
    data, not a credential.

Protocol behaviour implements 3GPP specifications, including TS 29.214 (Rx),
TS 29.228/29.229 (Cx), TS 29.514 (Npcf_PolicyAuthorization), TS 29.505/29.504
(Nudr), TS 23.040 and TS 24.011 (short message service), TS 33.102 and
TS 35.205-35.208 (authentication), and TS 23.003 (identifiers).

SETU interoperates with GPL-licensed software, such as Kamailio, exclusively over
network protocols. No GPL-licensed code is included in, linked with, or derived
from in this project.
